.TH IMUD\-INFLUXDB.CONF 5 "2026-07-15" "imud 1.5.1" "File Formats Manual"
.SH NAME
imud\-influxdb.conf \- configuration file for imud-influxdb(8)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I /etc/imud/imud-influxdb.conf
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configuration for the
.BR imud-influxdb (8)
bridge daemon, which reads imud's binary stream socket and writes InfluxDB
line-protocol points over UDP or HTTP.  The bridge reads
.B only
this file (never
.IR imud.conf ).
The file is one
.B [imud-influxdb]
section of
.IR key " = " value
lines; strings are double-quoted and
.RB \(oq # \(cq
begins a comment.  Requires imud's
.B [stream]
output enabled.
.PP
Keys marked
.B [hot]
are reloaded on
.BR SIGHUP ;
keys marked
.B [restart]
take effect on the next service start.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B enabled
.RI ( bool ,\ default:\ false )\ [restart]
Enable the InfluxDB bridge.
.TP
.B socket
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dq/run/imud/imud-stream.sock\(dq )\ [restart]
imud stream socket to read.
.TP
.B transport
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dqudp\(dq )\ [restart]
.B udp
or
.BR http .
.TP
.B rate_hz
.RI ( int ,\ default:\ 10 )\ [hot]
Point emit rate in Hz.
.TP
.B measurement
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dqimud\(dq )\ [hot]
Line-protocol measurement name.
.TP
.B source_label
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dqimud\(dq )\ [hot]
Value of the
.B source=
tag.
.TP
.B units
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dqdeg\(dq )\ [hot]
.B deg
(degrees, \(de/min) or
.B rad
(SI: radians, rad/s).
.TP
.B publish_heave
.RI ( bool ,\ default:\ true )\ [hot]
Include the
.B heave
field.
.TP
.B udp_addr
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dq127.0.0.1\(dq )\ [hot]
UDP destination host (InfluxDB 1.x listener or Telegraf).
.TP
.B udp_port
.RI ( int ,\ default:\ 8089 )\ [hot]
UDP destination port.
.TP
.B http_host
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dq127.0.0.1\(dq )\ [restart]
HTTP host (when
.B transport
= http).
.TP
.B http_port
.RI ( int ,\ default:\ 8086 )\ [restart]
HTTP port.
.TP
.B http_path
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dq/write?db=imud&precision=ns\(dq )\ [restart]
Write path: 1.x
.IR /write?db=<db> ,
or 2.x
.IR /api/v2/write?org=<org>&bucket=<bucket> ,
with
.BR precision=ns .
.TP
.B http_token
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dq\(dq )\ [restart]
InfluxDB 2.x API token (plaintext \(em protect the file).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/imud/imud-influxdb.conf
This file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR imud-influxdb (8),
.BR imud.conf (5),
.BR imud (8)
